# CIS
### Filesystem Configuration
#### 1.1.1.1 Ensure mounting of cramfs filesystems is disabled (Automated)
#### 1.1.1.2 Ensure freevxfs kernel module is not available(Automated) 
#### 1.1.1.3 Ensure hfs kernel module is not available (Automated)
#### 1.1.1.4 Ensure hfsplus kernel module is not available (Automated)
#### 1.1.1.5 Ensure jffs2 kernel module is not available (Automated)
#### 1.1.1.6 Ensure overlayfs kernel module is not available
#### 1.1.1.7 Ensure mounting of squashfs filesystems is disabled (Automated)
#### 1.1.1.8 Ensure mounting of udf filesystems is disabled (Automated)
#### 1.1.1.9 Ensure firewire-core kernel module is not available (Automated)
cat >/etc/modprobe.d/filesystems.conf <<EOF
# 1.1.1.9
install cramfs /bin/true
blacklist cramfs
install squashfs /bin/true
blacklist squashfs
install udf /bin/true
blacklist udf
install freevxfs /bin/true
blacklist freevxfs
install hfs /bin/true
blacklist hfs
install hfsplus /bin/true
blacklist hfsplus
install jffs2 /bin/true
blacklist jffs2
install firewire-core /bin/true
blacklist firewire-core
install overlayfs /bin/true
blacklist overlayfs
EOF
### 1.1.1.10 Ensure usb-storage kernel module is not available (Automated)
cat >/etc/modprobe.d/usb.conf <<EOF
# 1.1.1.10
install usb-storage /bin/true
blacklist usb-storage
EOF

### 1.1.2.1 Configure /tmp
#### 1.1.2.1.1 Ensure /tmp is a separate partition (Automated) -  Default
#### 1.1.2.1.2 Ensure nodev option set on /tmp partition (Automated) -  Default
#### 1.1.2.1.3 Ensure nosuid option set on /tmp partition (Automated) - Default
#### 1.1.2.1.4 Ensure noexec option set on /tmp partition (Automated) - Default
# Fix tmp noexec (1.1.2.1.4), looks correct in preseed but not applied??
sed -i 's|/dev/mapper/vgsys-lvtmp /tmp            ext4    nodev,nosuid    0       2|/dev/mapper/vgsys-lvtmp /tmp            ext4    nodev,nosuid,noexec    0       2|' /etc/fstab
### 1.1.2.2 Configure /dev/shm
#### 1.1.2.2.1 Ensure /dev/shm is a separate partition (Automated)
#### 1.1.2.2.2 Ensure nodev option set on /dev/shm partition (Automated
#### 1.1.2.2.3 Ensure nosuid option set on /dev/shm partition (Automated)
#### 1.1.2.2.4 Ensure noexec option set on /dev/shm partition (Automated)
echo "tmpfs                   /dev/shm                tmpfs   defaults,nodev,nosuid,noexec 0       0" >> /etc/fstab
### 1.1.2.3 Configure /home
#### 1.1.2.3.1 Ensure separate partition exists for /home (Automated) - Default
#### 1.1.2.3.2 Ensure nodev option set on /home partition (Automated) - Default
#### 1.1.2.3.3 Ensure nosuid option set on /home partition (Automated) - Default
### 1.1.2.4 Configure /var
#### 1.1.2.4.1 Ensure separate partition exists for /var (Automated) - Default
