#### 1.1.2.4.3 Ensure nosuid option set on /var partition (Automated) - Default
### 1.1.2.5 Configure /var/tmp
#### 1.1.2.5.1 Ensure separate partition exists for /var/tmp (Automated) - Default
#### 1.1.2.5.2 Ensure noexec option set on /var/tmp partition (Automated) - Default
#### 1.1.2.5.3 Ensure nosuid option set on /var/tmp partition (Automated) - Default
#### 1.1.2.5.4 Ensure nodev option set on /var/tmp partition (Automated) - Default
### 1.1.2.6 Configure /var/log
