# stays enabled; addressing comes from ipplan via the installer
### 3.1.2 Ensure wireless interfaces are disabled (Automated) - Default
### 3.1.3 Ensure bluetooth devices are disabled (Automated) - Default
### 3.2.1 Ensure atm kernel module is not available (Automated)
### 3.2.2 Ensure can kernel module is not available (Automated)
### 3.2.3 Ensure DCCP is disabled (Automated) - Default
### 3.2.4 Ensure RDS is disabled (Automated) - Default
### 3.2.5 Ensure SCTP is disabled (Automated) - Default
### 3.2.6 Ensure TIPC is disabled (Automated) - Default
